1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:01,529
Hi friends!

2
00:00:01,529 --> 00:00:02,531
I'm Mimzi,

3
00:00:02,531 --> 00:00:04,149
and this is Teddy!

4
00:00:04,699 --> 00:00:06,424
Hello!

5
00:00:06,974 --> 00:00:11,024
Let's go on a safari and meet the wild animals!

6
00:00:12,724 --> 00:00:14,899
Look! It's a lion.

7
00:00:15,399 --> 00:00:16,975
Lion!

8
00:00:17,525 --> 00:00:19,675
What does the lion say?

9
00:00:21,075 --> 00:00:22,725
Roar!

10
00:00:23,275 --> 00:00:26,225
The lion is the king of the jungle.

11
00:00:27,925 --> 00:00:29,800
Who is this?

12
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:33,775
It's an elephant!

13
00:00:34,325 --> 00:00:36,675
What does the elephant say?

14
00:00:38,075 --> 00:00:40,025
Toot, toot!

15
00:00:40,575 --> 00:00:43,250
The elephant has a long trunk.

16
00:00:44,950 --> 00:00:47,100
Look! It's a giraffe.

17
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:49,124
Giraffe!

18
00:00:49,674 --> 00:00:52,674
The giraffe has a long, long neck.

19
00:00:54,374 --> 00:00:56,674
Look! It's a zebra.

20
00:00:57,174 --> 00:00:58,823
Zebra!

21
00:00:59,373 --> 00:01:02,423
The zebra has black and white stripes.

22
00:01:04,123 --> 00:01:05,998
Who is this?

23
00:01:07,798 --> 00:01:09,922
It's a monkey!

24
00:01:10,472 --> 00:01:12,672
What does the monkey say?

25
00:01:14,072 --> 00:01:16,447
Ooh, ooh, ah, ah!

26
00:01:16,997 --> 00:01:19,547
The monkey loves bananas.

27
00:01:21,247 --> 00:01:24,095
Now let's play a memory game!

28
00:01:24,645 --> 00:01:26,234
Do you remember?

29
00:01:26,234 --> 00:01:27,320
Let's see!

30
00:01:29,020 --> 00:01:30,920
What is this?

31
00:01:33,120 --> 00:01:34,696
Lion!

32
00:01:35,246 --> 00:01:37,546
Yes! Well done!

33
00:01:39,246 --> 00:01:41,146
What is this?

34
00:01:43,346 --> 00:01:44,897
Elephant!

35
00:01:45,447 --> 00:01:47,397
That's right!

36
00:01:49,097 --> 00:01:50,997
What is this?

37
00:01:53,197 --> 00:01:54,721
Giraffe!

38
00:01:55,271 --> 00:01:57,296
Great job!

39
00:01:58,996 --> 00:02:00,896
What is this?

40
00:02:03,096 --> 00:02:04,745
Zebra!

41
00:02:05,295 --> 00:02:07,270
You got it!

42
00:02:08,970 --> 00:02:10,870
What is this?

43
00:02:13,070 --> 00:02:14,694
Monkey!

44
00:02:15,244 --> 00:02:16,944
Super!

45
00:02:18,644 --> 00:02:21,670
Wow! You remembered everything!

46
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:26,170
You are a super learner!

47
00:02:27,870 --> 00:02:31,321
Wow! The wild animals are amazing!

48
00:02:31,871 --> 00:02:34,671
Great job, little learner!

49
00:02:35,221 --> 00:02:37,172
Share Mimzi with a friend,

50
00:02:37,172 --> 00:02:39,796
and subscribe for more learning fun!

51
00:02:40,346 --> 00:02:41,392
Next time,

52
00:02:41,392 --> 00:02:43,646
let's dive under the sea.

53
00:02:43,896 --> 00:02:45,622
Bye bye!
